00:45:59.310 --> 00:46:19.700
<v Molly Antopol>Fundamental felt too businesslike, so I crossed it out and tried again. And as I sat back and worked through the next line, I wondered if any of these thoughts would begin to feel like my own. They didn't yet, but I was just getting started.
<v Molly Antopol>莫莉·安托波尔。她在斯坦福大学教授创意写作，目前正在创作一本短篇小说集和一部小说。

